    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/8e882aba18942076317fed51aec43d4a.poster.avif?t=1716499704\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/8e882aba18942076317fed51aec43d4a.webm?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/8e882aba18942076317fed51aec43d4a.mp4?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You are <strong>Axel Miller</strong>, a carpenter looking for work. After taking on an internship at a lumber mill company, you're suddenly struck from behind, plunging into unconsciousness. Six months later, you awaken, resuming your duties as if nothing transpired.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/7e44c3bbc9ec965439d6d688fb786885.poster.avif?t=1716499704\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/7e44c3bbc9ec965439d6d688fb786885.webm?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/7e44c3bbc9ec965439d6d688fb786885.mp4?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Moesgaard Skov is lush with extraordinary trees prime for chopping! Using your trusty chainsaw, and your electric trolley, you set out on adventures away from the safety of the mill.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/239202d14f6d3d385afcc3ab6d374a55.poster.avif?t=1716499704\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/239202d14f6d3d385afcc3ab6d374a55.webm?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/239202d14f6d3d385afcc3ab6d374a55.mp4?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chopping is only the first part, now you gotta prepare the logs! Debark, Slice, and Saw each log into what shape and size your <strong>Boss</strong> demands of you. Each Task demands a unique sequence of actions, demanding foresight and strategic planning to utilize each last log!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/73832a8a2294a265b3c826f7f3c4f33f.poster.avif?t=1716499704\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/73832a8a2294a265b3c826f7f3c4f33f.webm?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/73832a8a2294a265b3c826f7f3c4f33f.mp4?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There's more to Moesgaard Skov than work. Take some time to explore the forest and discover the secrets of your job. But don't go too far, or <strong>The Boss</strong> won't approve.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/8e882aba18942076317fed51aec43d4a.poster.avif?t=1716499704\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/8e882aba18942076317fed51aec43d4a.webm?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/8e882aba18942076317fed51aec43d4a.mp4?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You are <strong>Axel Miller</strong>, a carpenter looking for work. After taking on an internship at a lumber mill company, you're suddenly struck from behind, plunging into unconsciousness. Six months later, you awaken, resuming your duties as if nothing transpired.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/7e44c3bbc9ec965439d6d688fb786885.poster.avif?t=1716499704\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/7e44c3bbc9ec965439d6d688fb786885.webm?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/7e44c3bbc9ec965439d6d688fb786885.mp4?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Moesgaard Skov is lush with extraordinary trees prime for chopping! Using your trusty chainsaw, and your electric trolley, you set out on adventures away from the safety of the mill.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/239202d14f6d3d385afcc3ab6d374a55.poster.avif?t=1716499704\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/239202d14f6d3d385afcc3ab6d374a55.webm?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/239202d14f6d3d385afcc3ab6d374a55.mp4?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chopping is only the first part, now you gotta prepare the logs! Debark, Slice, and Saw each log into what shape and size your <strong>Boss</strong> demands of you. Each Task demands a unique sequence of actions, demanding foresight and strategic planning to utilize each last log!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/73832a8a2294a265b3c826f7f3c4f33f.poster.avif?t=1716499704\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/73832a8a2294a265b3c826f7f3c4f33f.webm?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973110/extras/73832a8a2294a265b3c826f7f3c4f33f.mp4?t=1716499704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There's more to Moesgaard Skov than work. Take some time to explore the forest and discover the secrets of your job. But don't go too far, or <strong>The Boss</strong> won't approve.",
